<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= skip_many \\* t. (p : parser t) : parser () = \\ t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.skip_many\" \\ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }\n    :~ ^ 루프 (i' : int) (s' : parser_state) =\n        ?= p (t, i', s') ?|\n        | Error _ => Ok ((), i', s')\n        | Ok (_, i'', s'') =>\n            ? i'' <> i'\n            ?> s'' |> 루프 i''\n            |: fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.skip_many / inner parser consumed no text\") i' s'\n    s |> 루프 i","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := skip_many \* t. (p : parser t) : parser () = \ t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.skip_many" \ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }
      :~ ^ 루프 (i' : int) (s' : parser_state) =
          ?= p (t, i', s') ?|
          | Error _ => Ok ((), i', s')
          | Ok (_, i'', s'') =>
              ? i'' <> i'
              ?> s'' |> 루프 i''
              |: fail (\ _ => "parsing.skip_many / inner parser consumed no text") i' s'
      s |> 루프 i
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

