<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= (.>>) \\* t u. (a : parser t) (b : parser u) : parser t = \\ t, i, s =>\n    ?= a (t, i, s) ?|\n    | Error e => e |> Error\n    | Ok (ra, i', s') =>\n        b (t, i', s')\n        |> resultm::map \\ _, i'', s'' =>\n            ra, i'', s''\n\n:= (.>>.) \\* t u. (a : parser t) (b : parser u) : parser ((() -> t) * (() -> u)) = \\ t, i, s =>\n    ?= a (t, i, s) ?|\n    | Error e => e |> Error\n    | Ok (ra, i', s') =>\n        b (t, i', s')\n        |> resultm::map \\ rb, i'', s'' =>\n            ((\\ () => ra), (\\ () => rb)), i'', s''\n\n:= (>>%) \\* t u. (a : parser t) (b : u) : parser u =\n    a >> resultm::map \\ _, i', s' =>\n        b, i', s'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := (.>>) \* t u. (a : parser t) (b : parser u) : parser t = \ t, i, s =>
      ?= a (t, i, s) ?|
      | Error e => e |> Error
      | Ok (ra, i', s') =>
          b (t, i', s')
          |> resultm::map \ _, i'', s'' =>
              ra, i'', s''

  := (.>>.) \* t u. (a : parser t) (b : parser u) : parser ((() -> t) * (() -> u)) = \ t, i, s =>
      ?= a (t, i, s) ?|
      | Error e => e |> Error
      | Ok (ra, i', s') =>
          b (t, i', s')
          |> resultm::map \ rb, i'', s'' =>
              ((\ () => ra), (\ () => rb)), i'', s''

  := (>>%) \* t u. (a : parser t) (b : u) : parser u =
      a >> resultm::map \ _, i', s' =>
          b, i', s'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

