<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= none_of (chars : list char) : parser char = \\ t, i, (parser_state s' &= s) =>\n    := chars' () =\n        chars |> listm'::box |> listm'::to_array' |> sm'::show\n    ? i >= s'::text_length ?>\n        fail (\\ _, _, s => \"parsing.none_of / unexpected end of text / \" ++# sm'::show { chars' = chars' (); s }) i s\n    |:\n        := ch = t |> sm'::index i\n        ? chars |> listm'::exists' ((=) ch) |> not\n        ?> Ok (ch, i + 1, ch |> update_char s)\n        |:\n            fail\n                \\ t, i, s =>\n                    \"parsing.none_of / unexpected char / \"\n                    ++# sm'::show { first_char = t |> sm'::index i; chars' = chars' (); s }\n                i s","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := none_of (chars : list char) : parser char = \ t, i, (parser_state s' &= s) =>
      := chars' () =
          chars |> listm'::box |> listm'::to_array' |> sm'::show
      ? i >= s'::text_length ?>
          fail (\ _, _, s => "parsing.none_of / unexpected end of text / " ++# sm'::show { chars' = chars' (); s }) i s
      |:
          := ch = t |> sm'::index i
          ? chars |> listm'::exists' ((=) ch) |> not
          ?> Ok (ch, i + 1, ch |> update_char s)
          |:
              fail
                  \ t, i, s =>
                      "parsing.none_of / unexpected char / "
                      ++# sm'::show { first_char = t |> sm'::index i; chars' = chars' (); s }
                  i s
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### none_of (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> rust\n///> gleam\n///> cuda\n///> typescript\n\n\"abc\"\n|> run_parser (none_of [ 'a'; 'b'; 'c' ])\n|> resultm::map_error eval\n|> _assert_eq (\n    \"parsing.none_of / unexpected char / \"\n    ++# (\n        \"{ first_char = a; chars' = [a, b, c]; s = { line_start = 0; position = { line = 1; col = 1 }; \"\n        ^^ \"text_length = 3 } }\"\n    )\n    |> Error\n)\n\n\"def\"\n|> run_parser (none_of [ 'a'; 'b'; 'c' ])\n|> resultm::get\n|> sm'::show\n|> _assert_eq (sm'::show ('d', \"ef\", new_parser_state 0 1 2 3))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

