```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= string_of \\* t. (x : t) : string =\n    ~>\n        ?= x ?|\n        | (_ : string) => x\n        | _ => sm'_real::format_real `t x\n\n:= many1_strings (p : parser _) : parser string = \\ t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.many1_strings\" \\ () => { t_len = ##t }\n    ?= p (t, i, s) ?|\n    | Error e => e |> Error\n    | Ok (r, i', s') =>\n        := first = string_of r\n        :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list string) (i'' : int) s'' : result (string * int * _) _ =\n            ?= p (t, i'', s'') ?|\n            | Error _ =>\n                := r =\n                    ?= acc ?|\n                    | [] => first\n                    | _ => first ++# (acc |> concat_rev)\n                Ok (r, i'', s'')\n            | Ok (r', i''', s''') ?& i''' > i'' => s''' |> 루프 (string_of r' :: acc) i'''\n            | Ok _ => fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.many1_strings / inner parser succeeded without consuming text\") i'' s''\n        s' |> 루프 [] i'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := string_of \* t. (x : t) : string =
      ~>
          ?= x ?|
          | (_ : string) => x
          | _ => sm'_real::format_real `t x

  := many1_strings (p : parser _) : parser string = \ t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.many1_strings" \ () => { t_len = ##t }
      ?= p (t, i, s) ?|
      | Error e => e |> Error
      | Ok (r, i', s') =>
          := first = string_of r
          :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list string) (i'' : int) s'' : result (string * int * _) _ =
              ?= p (t, i'', s'') ?|
              | Error _ =>
                  := r =
                      ?= acc ?|
                      | [] => first
                      | _ => first ++# (acc |> concat_rev)
                  Ok (r, i'', s'')
              | Ok (r', i''', s''') ?& i''' > i'' => s''' |> 루프 (string_of r' :: acc) i'''
              | Ok _ => fail (\ _ => "parsing.many1_strings / inner parser succeeded without consuming text") i'' s''
          s' |> 루프 [] i'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

