<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= many_strings (p : parser _) : parser string = \\ t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.many_strings\" \\ () => { t_len = ##t }\n    ?= p (t, i, s) ?|\n    | Error _ => Ok (\"\", i, s)\n    | Ok (_, i', _) ?& i' = i => fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.many_strings / first inner parser consumed no text\") i s\n    | Ok (r, i', s') ?& is_rust () =>\n        := buf : $'Rc<RefCell<std::string::String>>' = $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(std::string::String::new()))'\n        := push (x : string) : () = $'!buf.borrow_mut().push_str(&*!x)'\n        := first = string_of r\n        :~ ^ 루프 (n : int) (i' : int) s' : result (string * int * _) _ =\n            ?= p (t, i', s') ?|\n            | Error _ =>\n                := r = ? n = 0 ?> first |: $'Rc::<str>::from(!buf.borrow().as_str())' : string\n                Ok (r, i', s')\n            | Ok (r', i'', s'') ?& i'' > i' =>\n                ? n = 0 ?> push first\n                push (string_of r')\n                s'' |> 루프 (n + 1) i''\n            | Ok _ => fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.many_strings / inner parser succeeded without consuming text\") i' s'\n        s' |> 루프 0 i'\n    | Ok (r, i', s') =>\n        :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list string) (i' : int) s' : result (string * int * _) _ =\n            ?= p (t, i', s') ?|\n            | Error _ =>\n                := r = string_of r\n                := r =\n                    ?= acc ?|\n                    | [] => r\n                    | _ => r ++# (acc |> concat_rev)\n                Ok (r, i', s')\n            | Ok (r', i'', s'') ?& i'' > i' => s'' |> 루프 (string_of r' :: acc) i''\n            | Ok _ => fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.many_strings / inner parser succeeded without consuming text\") i' s'\n        s' |> 루프 [] i'\n\n:= choice \\* t. (ps : list (parser t)) : parser t =\n    := none : parser t = \\ _, i, s =>\n        fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.choice / no parsers succeeded\") i s\n    (ps, none) ||> listm::foldBack (<|>)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := many_strings (p : parser _) : parser string = \ t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.many_strings" \ () => { t_len = ##t }
      ?= p (t, i, s) ?|
      | Error _ => Ok ("", i, s)
      | Ok (_, i', _) ?& i' = i => fail (\ _ => "parsing.many_strings / first inner parser consumed no text") i s
      | Ok (r, i', s') ?& is_rust () =>
          := buf : $'Rc<RefCell<std::string::String>>' = $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(std::string::String::new()))'
          := push (x : string) : () = $'!buf.borrow_mut().push_str(&*!x)'
          := first = string_of r
          :~ ^ 루프 (n : int) (i' : int) s' : result (string * int * _) _ =
              ?= p (t, i', s') ?|
              | Error _ =>
                  := r = ? n = 0 ?> first |: $'Rc::<str>::from(!buf.borrow().as_str())' : string
                  Ok (r, i', s')
              | Ok (r', i'', s'') ?& i'' > i' =>
                  ? n = 0 ?> push first
                  push (string_of r')
                  s'' |> 루프 (n + 1) i''
              | Ok _ => fail (\ _ => "parsing.many_strings / inner parser succeeded without consuming text") i' s'
          s' |> 루프 0 i'
      | Ok (r, i', s') =>
          :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list string) (i' : int) s' : result (string * int * _) _ =
              ?= p (t, i', s') ?|
              | Error _ =>
                  := r = string_of r
                  := r =
                      ?= acc ?|
                      | [] => r
                      | _ => r ++# (acc |> concat_rev)
                  Ok (r, i', s')
              | Ok (r', i'', s'') ?& i'' > i' => s'' |> 루프 (string_of r' :: acc) i''
              | Ok _ => fail (\ _ => "parsing.many_strings / inner parser succeeded without consuming text") i' s'
          s' |> 루프 [] i'

  := choice \* t. (ps : list (parser t)) : parser t =
      := none : parser t = \ _, i, s =>
          fail (\ _ => "parsing.choice / no parsers succeeded") i s
      (ps, none) ||> listm::foldBack (<|>)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### choice (test)

