<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= between p_open p_close p_content : parser _ = \\ t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.between\" \\ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }\n    ?= p_open (t, i, s) ?|\n    | Ok (_, i', s') =>\n        ?= p_content (t, i', s') ?|\n        | Ok (result, i'', s'') =>\n            ?= p_close (t, i'', s'') ?|\n            | Ok (_, i''', s''') => Ok (result, i''', s''')\n            | Error e' =>\n                fail\n                    \\ t, _, _ =>\n                        := e = \\ () => e' |> error_message t\n                        := t_len = ##t\n                        := end' = (i' + get_max_context ()) |> min t_len\n                        := end'' = (i'' + get_max_context ()) |> min t_len\n                        := rest' = t |> slice i' end'\n                        := rest'' = t |> slice i'' end''\n                        \"parsing.between / expected closing delimiter / \" ++# sm'::show { e t rest' rest'' }\n                    i'' s''\n        | Error _ =>\n            ?= p_close (t, i', s') ?|\n            | Ok (_, i''', s''') => Ok (\"\", i''', s''')\n            | Error _ =>\n                fail\n                    \\ t, i', _ =>\n                        := end' = (i' + get_max_context ()) |> min ##t\n                        := rest' = t |> slice i' end'\n                        \"parsing.between / expected content or closing delimiter / \" ++# sm'::show { rest' }\n                    i' s'\n    | Error e => e |> Error","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := between p_open p_close p_content : parser _ = \ t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.between" \ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }
      ?= p_open (t, i, s) ?|
      | Ok (_, i', s') =>
          ?= p_content (t, i', s') ?|
          | Ok (result, i'', s'') =>
              ?= p_close (t, i'', s'') ?|
              | Ok (_, i''', s''') => Ok (result, i''', s''')
              | Error e' =>
                  fail
                      \ t, _, _ =>
                          := e = \ () => e' |> error_message t
                          := t_len = ##t
                          := end' = (i' + get_max_context ()) |> min t_len
                          := end'' = (i'' + get_max_context ()) |> min t_len
                          := rest' = t |> slice i' end'
                          := rest'' = t |> slice i'' end''
                          "parsing.between / expected closing delimiter / " ++# sm'::show { e t rest' rest'' }
                      i'' s''
          | Error _ =>
              ?= p_close (t, i', s') ?|
              | Ok (_, i''', s''') => Ok ("", i''', s''')
              | Error _ =>
                  fail
                      \ t, i', _ =>
                          := end' = (i' + get_max_context ()) |> min ##t
                          := rest' = t |> slice i' end'
                          "parsing.between / expected content or closing delimiter / " ++# sm'::show { rest' }
                      i' s'
      | Error e => e |> Error
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

