<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= sep_by \\* b. p sep : parser (list b) = \\ t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.sep_by\" \\ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }\n    ?= p (t, i, s) ?|\n    | Error _ => Ok ([], i, s)\n    | Ok (first, i', s') =>\n        :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list b) (i'' : int) s'' : result (list b * int * parser_state) _ =\n            ?= sep (t, i'', s'') ?|\n            | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i'', s'')\n            | Ok (_, i''', s''') =>\n                ? i''' = i'' ?>\n                    fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.sep_by / separator consumed no text\") i'' s''\n                |:\n                    ?= p (t, i''', s''') ?|\n                    | Ok (x, i'''', s'''') => s'''' |> 루프 (x :: acc) i''''\n                    | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i'', s'')\n        s' |> 루프 [ first ] i'\n\n:= sep_end_by \\* b. p sep : parser (list b) = \\ t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.sep_end_by\" \\ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }\n    :~ ^ 루프 acc i' s' =\n        ?= p (t, i', s') ?|\n        | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i', s')\n        | Ok (x, i'', s'') =>\n            ? i'' = i' ?>\n                fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.sep_end_by / element parser consumed no text\") i' s'\n            |:\n                := acc' = x :: acc\n                ?= sep (t, i'', s'') ?|\n                | Error _ => Ok (acc' |> listm::rev, i'', s'')\n                | Ok (_, i''', s''') =>\n                    ? i''' <> i''\n                    ?> s''' |> 루프 acc' i'''\n                    |: fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.sep_end_by / separator consumed no text\") i'' s''\n    s |> 루프 [] i","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := sep_by \* b. p sep : parser (list b) = \ t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.sep_by" \ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }
      ?= p (t, i, s) ?|
      | Error _ => Ok ([], i, s)
      | Ok (first, i', s') =>
          :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list b) (i'' : int) s'' : result (list b * int * parser_state) _ =
              ?= sep (t, i'', s'') ?|
              | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i'', s'')
              | Ok (_, i''', s''') =>
                  ? i''' = i'' ?>
                      fail (\ _ => "parsing.sep_by / separator consumed no text") i'' s''
                  |:
                      ?= p (t, i''', s''') ?|
                      | Ok (x, i'''', s'''') => s'''' |> 루프 (x :: acc) i''''
                      | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i'', s'')
          s' |> 루프 [ first ] i'

  := sep_end_by \* b. p sep : parser (list b) = \ t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.sep_end_by" \ () => { t_len = ##t; i s }
      :~ ^ 루프 acc i' s' =
          ?= p (t, i', s') ?|
          | Error _ => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i', s')
          | Ok (x, i'', s'') =>
              ? i'' = i' ?>
                  fail (\ _ => "parsing.sep_end_by / element parser consumed no text") i' s'
              |:
                  := acc' = x :: acc
                  ?= sep (t, i'', s'') ?|
                  | Error _ => Ok (acc' |> listm::rev, i'', s'')
                  | Ok (_, i''', s''') =>
                      ? i''' <> i''
                      ?> s''' |> 루프 acc' i'''
                      |: fail (\ _ => "parsing.sep_end_by / separator consumed no text") i'' s''
      s |> 루프 [] i
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

