<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= many_till \\* b c. (p : parser b) (end_p : parser c) : parser _ = \\ t, i, s =>\n    trace_entry \"parsing.many_till\" \\ () => { i t_len = ##t }\n    :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list b) (i' : int) s' : result (_ * int * parser_state) _ =\n        ?= end_p (t, i', s') ?|\n        | Ok (_, i'', s'') => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i'', s'')\n        | Error _ =>\n            ?= p (t, i', s') ?|\n            | Ok (x, i'', s'') =>\n                ? i'' <> i'\n                ?> s'' |> 루프 (x :: acc) i''\n                |: fail (\\ _ => \"parsing.many_till / inner parser succeeded without consuming text\") i' s'\n            | Error e => e |> Error\n    s |> 루프 [] i","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := many_till \* b c. (p : parser b) (end_p : parser c) : parser _ = \ t, i, s =>
      trace_entry "parsing.many_till" \ () => { i t_len = ##t }
      :~ ^ 루프 (acc : list b) (i' : int) s' : result (_ * int * parser_state) _ =
          ?= end_p (t, i', s') ?|
          | Ok (_, i'', s'') => Ok (acc |> listm::rev, i'', s'')
          | Error _ =>
              ?= p (t, i', s') ?|
              | Ok (x, i'', s'') =>
                  ? i'' <> i'
                  ?> s'' |> 루프 (x :: acc) i''
                  |: fail (\ _ => "parsing.many_till / inner parser succeeded without consuming text") i' s'
              | Error e => e |> Error
      s |> 루프 [] i
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

