<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= pipe2 \\* a b c. (p1 : parser a) (p2 : parser b) (f : ((() -> a) * (() -> b)) -> c) : parser c = \\ t, i, s =>\n    ?= p1 (t, i, s) ?|\n    | Error e => e |> Error\n    | Ok (ra, i', s') =>\n        p2 (t, i', s')\n        |> resultm::map \\ rb, i'', s'' =>\n            f ((\\ () => ra), (\\ () => rb)), i'', s''","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := pipe2 \* a b c. (p1 : parser a) (p2 : parser b) (f : ((() -> a) * (() -> b)) -> c) : parser c = \ t, i, s =>
      ?= p1 (t, i, s) ?|
      | Error e => e |> Error
      | Ok (ra, i', s') =>
          p2 (t, i', s')
          |> resultm::map \ rb, i'', s'' =>
              f ((\ () => ra), (\ () => rb)), i'', s''
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

