<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= new_lines1 () : parser () = \\ t, i, (parser_state s' &= s) =>\n    := i', s'' = s |> advance_newlines t i\n    ? i' <> i\n    ?> Ok ((), i', s'')\n    |:\n        fail\n            \\ t, i, (parser_state s') =>\n                := preview_end = i + get_max_context () |> min s'::text_length\n                \"parsing.new_lines1 / expected at least one new line / \"\n                ++# sm'::show { rest = t |> slice i preview_end }\n            i s","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := new_lines1 () : parser () = \ t, i, (parser_state s' &= s) =>
      := i', s'' = s |> advance_newlines t i
      ? i' <> i
      ?> Ok ((), i', s'')
      |:
          fail
              \ t, i, (parser_state s') =>
                  := preview_end = i + get_max_context () |> min s'::text_length
                  "parsing.new_lines1 / expected at least one new line / "
                  ++# sm'::show { rest = t |> slice i preview_end }
              i s
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

